{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD REBORN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a seamless, cinematic 2.5D world in Unreal Engine 5. No loading screens. No interruptions. Fluid exploration, vertical biomes, and combat that flows in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.poster.avif?t=1765504048\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.webm?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.mp4?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1765504048\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLIGHT CHANGES EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight is freedom. Soar across layered verticality, dive into hidden depths, and battle in enemy-filled skies. The more you master flight, the more the world opens: <strong>new areas, foes, routes, and challenges</strong> only reachable to skilled flyers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSORB. ADAPT. BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and absorb their <strong>Essences</strong> and <strong>Mystic Natures</strong> to forge distinct builds: with unique stats, weapons, and spell affinities. Swap builds to counter bosses, exploit affinities, and revisit areas with new tools and routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/6598356e6aa1e717768065cea4abc1aa.poster.avif?t=1765504048\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/6598356e6aa1e717768065cea4abc1aa.webm?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/6598356e6aa1e717768065cea4abc1aa.mp4?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSORBE AND CHANGE WHO YOU ARE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>RENASCENCE</i> continues the saga introduced in <i>ORIGINS</i>, but your perspective here matters. The Absorption system and Memory Cabinet allow you to <strong>equip memories</strong> alongside your <strong>build</strong>, curating how the story unfolds. Canonical encounters provide the backbone of the story; limited extra slots allow you to obtain alternative memories and experience the narrative from your viewpoint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE MEMORY CABINET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind as an inventory.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Canonical memories</strong>: fixed milestones that anchor the main plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipable memories (limited slots)</strong>: choose which memories to keep to alter context, unlock powers, or reframe events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlocking slots</strong>: special items expand capacity, letting you replace or add memories to reshape your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you remember changes what you can do, and how you understand the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMBAT EVOLVED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, stamina-driven combat meets spellcraft. Chain aerial strikes, parries, and Nature-infused spells. Elemental affinities matter: the wrong spell can <strong>heal</strong> your foe; the right one <strong>destroys it</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONSEQUENCES THAT ENDURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who you fight, what you absorb, and which memories you equip ripple across exploration, encounters, and story beats. The world remembers, even when you choose to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1765504048\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless 2.5D world in Unreal Engine 5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight with a fully physics-based core mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Essence/Nature absorption shaping flexible <strong>builds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory Cabinet</strong>: curate your perspective with limited memory slots (expandable via special items)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental affinity system: risk/reward where wrong spells can backfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next-gen visuals, cinematic presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical, stamina-based combat tuned for gamepad precision</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1765504048\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/beac6993319c234c57308a1bd7a64759.poster.avif?t=1765504048\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/beac6993319c234c57308a1bd7a64759.webm?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/beac6993319c234c57308a1bd7a64759.mp4?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1369430?t=1765504048","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765504048","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765504048","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765504048","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violence including sword fights  and dead bodies"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD REBORN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a seamless, cinematic 2.5D world in Unreal Engine 5. No loading screens. No interruptions. Fluid exploration, vertical biomes, and combat that flows in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.poster.avif?t=1765504048\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.webm?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.mp4?t=1765504048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/7c2117e7606941aee4dfde24a6de7323.avif?t=1765504048\" width=962 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FLIGHT CHANGES EVERYTHING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flight is freedom. Soar across layered verticality, dive into hidden depths, and battle in enemy-filled skies. The more you master flight, the more the world opens: <strong>new areas, foes, routes, and challenges</strong> only reachable to skilled flyers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABSORB. ADAPT. BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and absorb their <strong>Essences</strong> and <strong>Mystic Natures</strong> to forge distinct builds: with unique stats, weapons, and spell affinities. Swap builds to counter bosses, exploit affinities, and revisit areas with new tools and routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: cente